o-to-gif-converter.gif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image product"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb191b8_arrow-light-grey.svg" loading="lazy" width="40" data-w-id="f7c356cc-874c-7e67-5ee6-f30b511cc8b8" alt="" class="white-arrow-services"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a662320fa563c08e1e7f7_Aandrijvingen.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="gif-still"/></div><div data-w-id="e7d3afcb-8f1c-93d8-983d-512d3009531c" class="product-overview-title-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19194_arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-8"/><h3 class="heading product-overview-springs">Aandrijvingen</h3></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide is-team w-dyn-item"><a data-w-id="060b2887-681a-8a30-9751-968051a9b919" href="/transportbanden/overige-banden" class="product-wrapper-overview w-inline-block"><div class="product-image-wrapper-overview"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/68dcbea4833ca98e5c5b8833_AnimatievoorbeeldType1200schalmenband-ezgif.com-resize%20(1).gif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image product"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb191b8_arrow-light-grey.svg" loading="lazy" width="40" data-w-id="f7c356cc-874c-7e67-5ee6-f30b511cc8b8" alt="" class="white-arrow-services"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a6607dd2b869934768d47_Overige%20banden.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="gif-still"/></div><div data-w-id="e7d3afcb-8f1c-93d8-983d-512d3009531c" class="product-overview-title-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19194_arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-8"/><h3 class="heading product-overview-springs">Overige Banden</h3></div></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section market-overview-home"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="title-wrapper-market-home"><div class="title-wrapper-left"><h2 data-w-id="c8815ada-c411-51b1-8c21-e7661db3a9a1" style="opacity:0" class="heading markets-home">Sectoren</h2><div data-w-id="6942bddb-2c10-53e9-1be4-976a4f7002b3" style="opacity:0" class="title-devider"></div><p data-w-id="96ef5b5c-db93-255d-0a25-ee604d20caa5" style="opacity:0" class="paragraph">Tribelt levert op maat gemaakte metalen transportbanden en aandrijvingen voor uiteenlopende sectoren, van brood- en bakkerijproducten tot groente-, fruit- en vleesverwerking. Onze transportoplossingen zorgen ervoor dat uw productielijn soepel, betrouwbaar en efficiënt blijft draaien.</p></div><div class="title-wrapper-right"><a data-wf--button--variant="dark---black" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white w-variant-3e0e42ae-bf53-1789-aee5-76ce2ee44d6b">Bekijk alle sectoren</div><div class="btn-line-white w-variant-3e0e42ae-bf53-1789-aee5-76ce2ee44d6b"></div></div><div class="btn-circle w-variant-3e0e42ae-bf53-1789-aee5-76ce2ee44d6b"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image w-variant-3e0e42ae-bf53-1789-aee5-76ce2ee44d6b"/></div></a></div></div><div data-w-id="5d4b5ccf-1c20-766f-eef8-b36b239d8666" style="opacity:0" class="slider-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="slider-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a682240d964195f5553d5_68dbf4fa3589cc3749d29466_Brood%20%26%20Banket_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Brood &amp; Banket</h3><p class="paragraph market-home">In de productie van brood en banket zijn transportbanden essentieel. Omdat producten direct contact hebben met de band, zijn hygiëne en voedselveiligheid cruciaal. Tribelt kan een “conformiteitsverklaring” verstrekken voor hoge kwaliteit.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/brood-banket" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a6819376ca58ba2180e06_68dbf50d40802023d2729f9a_AGF_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Aardappel, Groente en Fruit (AGF)</h3><p class="paragraph market-home">In de verwerking van aardappelen, groenten en fruit (AGF) zijn hygiëne, slijtvastheid en traceerbaarheid essentieel. Daarom worden metalen transportbanden veel gebruikt. Tribelt beschikt over uitgebreide kennis van bandtypen en de specifieke procesvereisten.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/aardappel-groente-en-fruit-agf" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a6812e8ef0f26c9411d0f_68dbf51b4c8c73633744f524_Vlees%20vis%20zuivel_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Vlees, Vis en Zuivel</h3><p class="paragraph market-home">In de verwerking van vlees, vis en zuivel zijn hygiëne, voedselveiligheid en duurzame verwerking cruciaal. Roestvrijstalen transportoplossingen en speciale banden zijn makkelijk te reinigen en bestand tegen zware belasting. Tribelt kent de procesvereisten.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/vlees-vis-en-zuivel" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a680bcc3dbeea833d1046_68dbf53a2dd5e0cdb377473b_vleesvervangers_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Vleesvervangers</h3><p class="paragraph market-home">Consumenten kiezen vaker plantaardige alternatieven van soja, erwten, lupine of andere eiwitrijke grondstoffen. Producenten van vleesvervangers hebben productielijnen nodig die betrouwbaar, hygiënisch en schaalbaar zijn om de groeiende vraag efficiënt te verwerken.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/vleesvervangers" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a67fec59bb61f32d29da3_68dbf548e56ef4317706bf2e_ovenbouwers_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Bakkerij- en ovenbouwers</h3><p class="paragraph market-home">Bakkerij- en ovenbouwers zijn een belangrijke doelgroep. In industriële bakkerijen transporteren transportbanden deeg, brood en banket betrouwbaar door ovens, koeltrajecten en verpakkingslijnen. Ze moeten hittebestendig, hygiënisch, onderhoudsvriendelijk en bestand tegen langdurige belasting zijn.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/bakkerij--en-ovenbouwers" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a67f5dd2b8699347769a9_68dbf5517fe93ef62dd5289c_productielijnen_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Productielijnen &amp; procesinstallaties</h3><p class="paragraph market-home">Machinebouwers van complete productielijnen behoren tot Tribelts kernklanten. Ze leveren geïntegreerde systemen aan voedingsmiddelen-, industriële productie- en automotive-sectoren. Metalen transportbanden zorgen voor betrouwbaar en efficiënt transport van producten door alle processtappen.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/productielijnen-procesinstallaties" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a6803c1ca9ee49905febf_68dbf55ab8aa92b574e524d4_maatwerkoplossingen_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Systeemintegratoren &amp; maatwerkoplossingen</h3><p class="paragraph market-home">Tribelt werkt nauw samen met systeemintegratoren die productiesystemen combineren, uitbreiden of aanpassen aan de wensen van de eindklant. Transportbanden spelen hierin een sleutelrol door verbinding te vormen tussen machines en processen.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/systeemintegratoren-maatwerkoplossingen" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a67d401389e5e73e9ced2_68dbf5654ce2f61ba31a7184_recycling_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Recycling </h3><p class="paragraph market-home">Recyclingprocessen vormen een zware omgeving voor transportbanden. Glas, kunststof en metaal worden verhit, gescheiden of bewerkt. Transportbanden moeten hitte, scherpe randen en zware belasting weerstaan. Tribelt levert metalen banden voor deze omstandigheden.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/recycling" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a682996bb2c7ac030bf26_68dbf4eb6eaf75ed2df6f1ca_afvalverwerking_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Afvalverwerking</h3><p class="paragraph market-home">Afvalverwerkingsbedrijven verwerken grote hoeveelheden reststromen, van huishoudelijk tot industrieel afval. Gescheiden, verbrand of thermisch behandeld, vereisen deze stromen transportbanden die sterk, slijtvast en bestand zijn tegen zware en extreme omstandigheden.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/afvalverwerking" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a6831833d25a03551e5dc_68dbf4e241ffc862b1e8b90d_filtratie_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Waterbehandeling &amp; Filtratie</h3><p class="paragraph market-home">Waterzuivering vereist transportbanden die vaste deeltjes, slib en vuil efficiënt verwijderen zonder de waterstroom te onderbreken. Transportbanden fungeren als schep-, uithaal- of filtermechanisme en zorgen voor effectief schoon water.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/waterbehandeling-filtratie" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a683896bb2c7ac030c53a_68dbf4d8687b5bf9d98ba3a3_Automotive_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Automotive </h3><p class="paragraph market-home">In coating- en lakstraten, hittebehandelingovens en reinigingsinstallaties worden auto-onderdelen blootgesteld aan hoge temperaturen en chemicaliën. Transportbanden in deze zware omstandigheden moeten uitzonderlijk sterk, slijtvast en betrouwbaar zijn voor continue prestaties.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/automotive" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a683fb5d873c1920c17b5_68dbf4ccf9d13952daa052b7_Zonne%20energie_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Zonne-energie &amp; Elektronica </h3><p class="paragraph market-home">De productie van zonnepanelen en halfgeleiders vereist uiterst gecontroleerde processen. Materialen worden verhit, gecoat of thermisch behandeld, waarbij zelfs minimale afwijkingen kunnen leiden tot productiefouten, kwaliteitsverlies en verminderde efficiëntie in de productielijn.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/zonne-energie-elektronica" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a68475348695f46a4c2c5_68dbf4c3274a54aae7884a59_Medische_converted.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Farmacie &amp; Medische hulpmiddelen </h3><p class="paragraph market-home">De farmaceutische en medische sector stelt hoge eisen aan hygiëne, betrouwbaarheid en precisie. Transportbanden moeten hitte, stoom en chemicaliën weerstaan en zorgen voor schoon, stabiel transport van gesteriliseerde ampullen, flacons en medische hulpmiddelen.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/farmacie-medische-hulpmiddelen" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19190_btn-arrow-black.svg" loading="lazy" width="10" alt="" class="image"/></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="slider-item w-dyn-item"><div data-w-id="7035b50d-c55a-80b6-191f-07ae12a368cb" class="market-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19188/6a9a684e4a9b18aa4f84af35_Interne%20transportoplossingen.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cover-image market_home"/><div class="market-info-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19196_white-arrow.svg" loading="lazy" width="38" alt="" class="image-2"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19172/68bae9b46e9ab68afdb19197_market-arrows.svg" loading="lazy" width="235" alt="" class="arrow-image-market-home"/><div class="case_info_wrapper"><h3 class="heading market-home">Interne transportoplossingen</h3><p class="paragraph market-home">Binnen logistieke processen zorgen interne transportbanden voor een efficiënte goederenstroom. Producenten en eindgebruikers vertrouwen op metalen transportbanden voor veilige, gecontroleerde en duurzame verplaatsing van producten met minimale stilstand.</p></div><a data-wf--button--variant="light---orange" data-w-id="1bd16001-914a-6da3-078b-294ca579c125" href="/sectoren/interne-transportoplossingen" class="btn brochure w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text-line"><div class="btn-text-white">Meer informatie</div><div class="btn-line-white"></div></div><div class="btn-circle"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-f